stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_transfer: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer specified token to designated address, emit EmergencyWithdraw

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: only legionOperator can invoke emergency withdrawal
        INV-002: can withdraw any ERC20 token held by contract
